 "caption": "See a feature you love in an app? Your AI agent can now figure out how it works.\n\nREA (Reverse Engineer Anything) is a free, open-source MCP for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and more. It inspects desktop and Electron apps, websites, Android APKs and native binaries, shows you the evidence, and lets your agent build a similar feature. Runs locally. Native binaries need Hopper, Ghidra or IDA.\n\nUse it only on software you own or are allowed to analyze.\n\nComment REA and I'll DM you the link.",
 "hashtags": [
  "#claudecode",
  "#aitools",
  "#opensource",
  "#reverseengineering"
 ],
